<InteractiveShowcase eyebrow="Explore by need" title="Custom journeys" intro="Choose a travel concept, request professional field support, or tell us exactly what you want to do in Afghanistan. Every custom journey is reviewed against access, seasonality, safety, permits, transport, lodging, and local coordination before confirmation." items={journeys} sectionId="custom-journeys" />
